To greet with person and greeting:
    Give back "{greeting}, {person}.".
End function.

Let constant hello_prefix as text be "Hello".
Let café as number be 2.
If false and (1 divided by 0 is equal to 0):
    Say "This branch should not run.".
Otherwise if café is equal to 2:
    Say greet(person="Ada", greeting=hello_prefix).
Otherwise:
    Say "The value was unexpected.".
End if.

Say "Unicode value: {café}.".
